      "id": "melitzanosalata",
      "title": "Melitzanosalata, smoky aubergine dip",
      "category": "dips-sauces",
      "description": "Charred aubergine and red pepper with garlic, vinegar, parsley and olive oil.",
      "added": "2026-11-22",
      "servings": 4,
